{"2657140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Animal Falling", "steam_appid": 2657140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>1. Place your traps</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/985f9a398ab7b9e6359234e7e3b044c8.poster.avif?t=1787821228\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/985f9a398ab7b9e6359234e7e3b044c8.webm?t=1787821228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/985f9a398ab7b9e6359234e7e3b044c8.mp4?t=1787821228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place your traps: activate crossbows, turn on giant fans, or plant electric carrots exactly where your rivals least expect them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pettier the move, the better.</p></p><br><h1>2. Start the race</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/5ef55449183e1d3f24080be61a86cdda.poster.avif?t=1787821228\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/5ef55449183e1d3f24080be61a86cdda.webm?t=1787821228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/5ef55449183e1d3f24080be61a86cdda.mp4?t=1787821228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gates open. The aniballs are released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll, bounce, and slide through a minefield you helped create yourself. Just don’t be surprised if your own evil genius backfires at the very first turn.</p></p><br><h1>3. Enjoy the fall</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/90842ca54f7a4ecd21ea7ce539028e34.poster.avif?t=1787821228\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/90842ca54f7a4ecd21ea7ce539028e34.webm?t=1787821228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/90842ca54f7a4ecd21ea7ce539028e34.mp4?t=1787821228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watching your best friend fly off the map two inches from the finish line brings a deep, guilty laugh that only pure betrayal can inspire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The frustration is real. The chaos is total. And suddenly, there’s only one thing you want to do: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start another match and get revenge on that treacherous rabbit.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The party game where winning mostly means making others fall</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal Falling is a chaotic multiplayer party game that mixes obstacle racing, player-placed traps, and creative sabotage in a colorful cartoon world ruled by chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your cute little aniballs to victory while dodging your friends’ traps… or your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/09f7b5f1d39985b78770c8d3c6d18979.poster.avif?t=1787821228\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/09f7b5f1d39985b78770c8d3c6d18979.webm?t=1787821228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/09f7b5f1d39985b78770c8d3c6d18979.mp4?t=1787821228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physically (and mentally) unstable animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Animal Falling, gravity is your worst enemy. And it brought friends.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll, slide, fall: Your chubby aniballs tumble and bounce in wildly unpredictable ways.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treacherous surfaces: Tornadoes that sweep you away, icy platforms that steal control… Every turn is a new opportunity to fail spectacularly.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/008bf167d15a3db490ee5a343d328e16.poster.avif?t=1787821228\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/008bf167d15a3db490ee5a343d328e16.webm?t=1787821228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/008bf167d15a3db490ee5a343d328e16.mp4?t=1787821228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traps with a mind of their own</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps are the heart of the game.<br>Discover a wide variety of tools designed to drive your friends crazy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔨 Spinning hammers that never stop<br> 🪨  Anvils that fall at the worst possible moment.<br> 🥕 Amazingly unpredictable electric carrots.<br> 🌀  Shady moving platforms you should never trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every trap can be combined.<br>Every setup can backfire.<br>Every round tells a different story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Biomes for every taste (and every fall)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Windy Islands</strong>: Where a gentle breeze can carry you away... into the abyss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snowy Mountains : </strong>Ideal for sliding on ice, getting stuck in deep snow, or taking a rock straight to the face.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmos:</strong> Perfect for hopping through teleports, dodging laser beams, or getting zapped by high-voltage traps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/7cf4ad7bc386a1740cab29477ac6d429.poster.avif?t=1787821228\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/7cf4ad7bc386a1740cab29477ac6d429.webm?t=1787821228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/7cf4ad7bc386a1740cab29477ac6d429.mp4?t=1787821228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play however you want (but play dirty)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local &amp; online multiplayer</strong>: Play with up to 4 players in split-screen or up to 6 players online.<br> The perfect game to spice up game nights… or ruin family dinners.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization &amp; fancy hats: </strong>Dress up your aniball in ridiculous accessories to stay stylish even while flying off the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist the game on Steam</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >chaotic party games,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >friendly betrayal,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >games that don’t take themselves too seriously...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add Animal Falling to your wishlist. It helps the game a lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/0b35eedfecea6c5a3542afd45d9644eb.avif?t=1787821228\" width=400 height=400 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The party game where winning mostly means making others fall</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal Falling is a chaotic multiplayer party game that mixes obstacle racing, player-placed traps, and creative sabotage in a colorful cartoon world ruled by chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your cute little aniballs to victory while dodging your friends’ traps… or your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/09f7b5f1d39985b78770c8d3c6d18979.poster.avif?t=1787821228\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/09f7b5f1d39985b78770c8d3c6d18979.webm?t=1787821228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657140/extras/09f7b5f1d39985b78770c8d3c6d18979.mp4?t=1787821228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Physically (and mentally) unstable animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Animal Falling, gravity is your worst enemy. And it brought friends.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll, slide, fall: Your chubby aniballs tumble and bounce in wildly u